==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Capsakid|28}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Playful Kick''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Mudkip|62}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

